# Changelog

## Unreleased

- Added clear fork attribution to the README files.
- Renamed package identifier to `@j1nn0/vanilla-autokana` in package metadata and usage examples.
- Updated package metadata for publication readiness (`contributors`, `description`, `repository`, `bugs`, `homepage`).
- Added modification copyright notice for `j1nn0` while preserving the original MIT copyright.
- Synchronized type definition module declaration with the published package name.
- Added `destroy()` to public type definitions to match runtime API.
- Expanded README option docs (`katakana`, `checkInterval`) and aligned script-tag examples with `dist/autokana.umd.js`.
- Expanded `README_en.md` with options and Vue/React integration guidance.
- Added integration tests for focus/blur timer lifecycle and keydown conversion reset.
- Added coverage configuration in Vitest and `test:coverage` / `ci` scripts for quality gates.